rrive at the school she meets a strange girl called Koyomi Morishita, who insists that she knows her. However, their 'reunion' is cut short when they are once again attacked by Guibarthez.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p6nBqOle2GnjC5FEWFZ89xzqMvU.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Yumiko Ichinose runs away from home to join the Anehara Cross School of Magic. On the way there she is accosted by a powerful mage who demands her grandfather's staff and is prepared to kill to get it. When she does finally arrive at the school she meets a strange girl called Koyomi Morishita, who insists that she knows her. However, their 'reunion' is cut short when they are once again attacked by Guibarthez.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p6nBqOle2GnjC5FEWFZ89xzqMvU.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"89409","synopsis":"Koyomi Morishita decides to join the Anehara Cross School of Magic but soon finds out from Misa Anehara that the school no longer exists. However, later whilst visiting Akihabara she once again encounters Misa and gets caught up in the world of 'Modern Magic'. After assisting her in capturing two criminals Koyomi finally earns her chance to study under the famous Misa Anehara.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cF0i5mWWYrYvgefRMabdH03pjyo.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Koyomi Morishita decides to join the Anehara Cross School of Magic but soon finds out from Misa Anehara that the school no longer exists. However, later whilst visiting Akihabara she once again encounters Misa and gets caught up in the world of 'Modern Magic'. After assisting her in capturing two criminals Koyomi finally earns her chance to study under the famous Misa Anehara.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cF0i5mWWYrYvgefRMabdH03pjyo.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"89410","synopsis":"Kaho and Koyomi are both now studying Modern Magic under Misa but Koyomi can still only produce pans. Later Koyomi meets Yumiko Christina Ichinose a powerful mage who is on the trail of a dangerous Daemon. The duo end up joining forces in order to catch the Daemon and retrieve Yumiko's stolen underwear. However, they soon end up involved in something far more dangerous.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zAGdTtnsc5nLJq7x3AobasldBXp.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Kaho and Koyomi are both now studying Modern Magic under Misa but Koyomi can still only produce pans. Later Koyomi meets Yumiko Christina Ichinose a powerful mage who is on the trail of a dangerous Daemon. The duo end up joining forces in order to catch the Daemon and retrieve Yumiko's stolen underwear. However, they soon end up involved in something far more dangerous.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zAGdTtnsc5nLJq7x3AobasldBXp.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"89411","synopsis":"Yumiko goes to Misa for help in finding the mage responsible for summoning the Daemons, and soon Kaho and Koyomi have been recruited to help too. It isn't long before their 'investigation' leads them to the local water park, where Kaho tries to teach Koyomi to swim. However, after Koyomi nearly drowns it becomes clear that there is a Genie terrorising the park. As such Misa and the others must stop it before anyone is seriously hurt.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nJVTu6sHrZJNcapLKeQ4c4DvSZh.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Yumiko goes to Misa for help in finding the mage responsible for summoning the Daemons, and soon Kaho and Koyomi have been recruited to help too. It isn't long before their 'investigation' leads them to the local water park, where Kaho tries to teach Koyomi to swim. However, after Koyomi nearly drowns it becomes clear that there is a Genie terrorising the park. As such Misa and the others must stop it before anyone is seriously hurt.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nJVTu6sHrZJNcapLKeQ4c4DvSZh.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"89412","synopsis":"Six years in the past, Koyomi tries to explain the reason she has come back in time to Misa and also to find away to get home. Meanwhile, Guibarthez is still pursuing Yumiko to gain possession of the Sorceress's Library.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A7Bsr40TLKpj9lDTiJG9cl8pO7z.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Six years in the past, Koyomi tries to explain the reason she has come back in time to Misa and also to find away to get home. Meanwhile, Guibarthez is still pursuing Yumiko to gain possession of the Sorceress's Library.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A7Bsr40TLKpj9lDTiJG9cl8pO7z.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"89413","synopsis":"Still in the past Koyomi decides joins forces with Yumiko in order to stop Guibarthez rather than returning to her own time straight away. However, when Guibarthez manages to get a hold of Kerykeion the girls may no longer be able to stop him, and even the timely arrival of Misa may not help them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/552DbPmzDYde5LmXKzjU5PlGDrm.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Still in the past Koyomi decides joins forces with Yumiko in order to stop Guibarthez rather than returning to her own time straight away. However, when Guibarthez manages to get a hold of Kerykeion the girls may no longer be able to stop him, and even the timely arrival of Misa may not help them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/552DbPmzDYde5LmXKzjU5PlGDrm.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"89414","synopsis":"Upset at her inability to use magic Koyomi decides that what she needs is a magical item to improve her skills and as such she heads to Shibuya with Kaho and Yumiko. However, even with her new Tortoise rucksack she is still unable to use any magic except her summoning spell.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/quexaT8ihZH6f2jkggkBeJi5c5r.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Upset at her inability to use magic Koyomi decides that what she needs is a magical item to improve her skills and as such she heads to Shibuya with Kaho and Yumiko. However, even with her new Tortoise rucksack she is still unable to use any magic except her summoning spell.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/quexaT8ihZH6f2jkggkBeJi5c5r.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"89415","synopsis":"Whilst investigating the connection between the various Daemon cases, Misa receives an email claiming that there is a bomb on board her flight home. However, when her search turns up nothing she realises tha the bomb threat has been nothing but a diversion. Meanwhile, Koyomi and the others decide to surprise Misa whilst she is away by cleaning up the house.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mUiopPYegwbp1UpNTbz3P5UeYxa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Whilst investigating the connection between the various Daemon cases, Misa receives an email claiming that there is a bomb on board her flight home. However, when her search turns up nothing she realises tha the bomb threat has been nothing but a diversion. Meanwhile, Koyomi and the others decide to surprise Misa whilst she is away by cleaning up the house.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mUiopPYegwbp1UpNTbz3P5UeYxa.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"89416","synopsis":"超高層ビル内のとある会社から仕事の依頼を受けた美鎖。何者かが姉原邸に泥棒に入ったこともあり、犯人の罠ではないかと思いつつ、こよみを連れて依頼主の元を訪れる。案の定、依頼主は存在せず、美鎖は相手が仕掛けてくるのを待つことに。そこへ、美鎖の仕事を止めるべく弓子が乗り込んできて…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/53VeBV45Drsoa4td3se8qltzBlV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"超高層ビル内のとある会社から仕事の依頼を受けた美鎖。何者かが姉原邸に泥棒に入ったこともあり、犯人の罠ではないかと思いつつ、こよみを連れて依頼主の元を訪れる。案の定、依頼主は存在せず、美鎖は相手が仕掛けてくるのを待つことに。そこへ、美鎖の仕事を止めるべく弓子が乗り込んできて…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/53VeBV45Drsoa4td3se8qltzBlV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"89417","synopsis":"弓子との戦いで深手を負った美鎖は瞬間移動のコードで弓子の前から消えてしまった。美鎖を助けるため、必死で美鎖を探す弓子。一方、嘉穂の家のポストに血がついた美鎖のアミュレットが投函されていた。嘉穂は自分にできることを察し、行動を起こす。こよみも昨日の出来事の真相を確かめるため、姉原邸を訪れるが…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dZOih7PkIvYNygNZZjCPCsW55MV.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"弓子との戦いで深手を負った美鎖は瞬間移動のコードで弓子の前から消えてしまった。美鎖を助けるため、必死で美鎖を探す弓子。一方、嘉穂の家のポストに血がついた美鎖のアミュレットが投函されていた。嘉穂は自分にできることを察し、行動を起こす。こよみも昨日の出来事の真相を確かめるため、姉原邸を訪れるが…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dZOih7PkIvYNygNZZjCPCsW55MV.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6332","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"5454","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"25275","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"102481","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"89418","synopsis":"ゴーストスクリプト化した美鎖と再会した弓子。美鎖からゲーリー・ホアンとギバルテスが伝説の魔女「ジギタリス・フランマキア」を甦らそうとしていることを知らされる。そこにゲーリー・ホアンとギバルテスが現れる。一方、こよみと嘉穂は秋葉原のとある路地裏に人払いのコードがめぐらされている一角を発見、そこで…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gFIyk0ikBY215Y8OQOXpZThdsKf.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"ゴーストスクリプト化した美鎖と再会した弓子。美鎖からゲーリー・ホアンとギバルテスが伝説の魔女「ジギタリス・フランマキア」を甦らそうとしていることを知らされる。そこにゲーリー・ホアンとギバルテスが現れる。一方、こよみと嘉穂は秋葉原のとある路地裏に人払いのコードがめぐらされている一角を発見、そこで…。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gFIyk0ikBY215Y8OQOXpZThdsKf.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"ja-JP"}}}